{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bRwqczIgcI1792727563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析預期，對港股後市走勢不太樂觀，恒指或有機會跌穿22,500點水平。</p><p></p><p>元宇證券基金投資總監林嘉麒稱︰「大家會擔心可能，一些消息會繼續發酵。例如剛才提及法國的示威事件如何，歐洲的債息變化如何，法國債息會否持續抽升，法國債息與德國息差會否進一步拉闊。另外是油價，這些都會限制港股今日反彈的幅度不是太樂觀，22,500點可以穩守。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:52.843877+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.786427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:58:06.606632+00:00","content_hash":"c5bc1e0d1714d5bc0f26127bf6c3aa32135bf3738212b97668300f2be7f18e6c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:52.843877+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}